Basic description: An allocation letter from All Purpose Shelters Limited regarding shop space allocation.

Expanded:
The document is titled "ALLOCATION LETTER" dated 16th August, 2023. It is addressed to Bob-Ogbonna Ugochinyere Marilyn at his address in Wuse Zone 6, FCT Abuja. The letter states that upon full payment, approval has been granted for the allocation of shop space COLDROOM 36 at Wuye Ultra-Modern (BOT) Market under certain conditions listed below:

a. Signing of a sales agreement by Developer and Shop Purchaser;
b. No structural alteration or additions allowed without written approval of All Purpose Shelters Limited;
c. Fee paid so far is non-refundable;
d. Individual standby generators are not allowed in the market;
e. Printing business prohibited in the market;
f. All shop owners/operators must settle statutory charges/levies/taxes passed on to the market by appropriate authorities;
g. Delay in settlement of statutory fees attracts 2% per month of default charge;
h. All shop owners must promptly settle service charges to All Purpose Shelters Limited which includes maintenance fee, security levy, generator service, packing of refuse.

